1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,549
Zinc is the odd one.

2
00:00:01,549 --> 00:00:08,593
Its atom is 3d ten, and its only ion, zinc two plus, is still 3d ten.

3
00:00:08,593 --> 00:00:17,773
No partly filled d subshell anywhere, so zinc is not a typical transition metal, and that is the first clue to our cold open.

